    "created_at": "2024-10-02T10:21:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-10-02T10:21:59Z",
    "body": "The WebSocket API intentionally doesn't expose the reasons for connection failure to JavaScript, to avoid cross-origin information leakage.\r\n\r\nWe could in principle expose the information if the connection was same-origin, or if the server had permitted it via some CORS-like mechanism.\r\n\r\nHowever, I don't know what the use case would be.",
