    "body": "First we need agreement as to whether we want to solve a particular problem. Then we can figure out the syntax needed for it. #16 and #18 are well-suited for exploring the former. If you want some other piece of information, best to file a dedicated issue for it with use cases and such. See also https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features.",
